# oracle: dump vtk of a triclinic (prism) box: legacy .vtk and XML .vtu atoms (UnstructuredGrid vertices) with the hexahedron bounding boxes
# oracle-files: tri0.vtk tri20.vtk tri0_boundingBox.vtk tri20_boundingBox.vtk tri0.vtu tri20.vtu tri0_boundingBox.vtu tri20_boundingBox.vtu
# oracle-compare: filerel=1e-7
# Measured with native LAMMPS: max relative error 0 on values above 1e-6 in all eight files (legacy and vtu atoms, hexahedron boxes); the largest absolute difference is 8.1e-13 on near-zero forces at step 0 (summation order). Native build: /home/roy/.local/bin/lmp (b332f28). Engine time about 0.3 s.
units           lj
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box prism 0 4 0 4 0 4 0.5 0.3 0.2
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.44 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix             1 all nve
dump            a all vtk 10 tri*.vtk id type vx fx
dump            b all vtk 10 tri*.vtu id type vx fx
thermo_style    custom step pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             20
